        ["typing-speed-test"] = S("typing speed test for programmers",
            "Measure your words per minute on real source code instead of prose. Snippets in C#, JavaScript and SQL include braces, semicolons, operators and indentation, so the result reflects how fast you actually type when coding. Accuracy, raw WPM and adjusted WPM are shown after each run.",
